  "description": "One review from the legendary Pi Do-Yeong can make or break a career. For So-Yeong, it did both. After saving her failing restaurant with a rave review, Do-Yeong’s strange behavior—visiting daily but refusing to eat—starts to ruin Verde’s credibility all over again. When So-Yeong corners him to settle the score, she finds a man driven mad by a thirst no wine can quench. Do-Yeong is a vampire losing control, and he’s just placed a very specific order. To save her life’s work, she enters a risky contract with the supernatural, but in this kitchen, the chef might just end up as the main course.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
